Commande :

```bash id="9tcrn7"
npm run build
```

---

# 3. Reload PM2

Commande :

```bash id="tx3owk"
pm2 reload api-backend
```

---

# 4. Flush logs PM2

Commande :

```bash id="ud6h8q"
