# Installation logrotate PM2

Installation :

```bash id="hn66d5"
pm2 install pm2-logrotate
```

Configuration :

```bash id="f17m1w"
pm2 set pm2-logrotate:max_size 10M
pm2 set pm2-logrotate:retain 7
pm2 set pm2-logrotate:compress true
```

Objectif :

* éviter accumulation monstrueuse des logs
* protéger le disque
* stabiliser PM2

